   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.1#p1-7a8fc1fd",
     "text": "By this Moses declares that he taught nothing to the people but that which he received from God.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "LORD called unto Moses"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.1.2",
   "range": "LEV.1.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c3d5f57f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.2#p1-c3d5f57f",
     "text": "So they could offer of no other sort, but of those who were commanded.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "cattle"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.1.3",
   "range": "LEV.1.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "76fac24c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.3#p1-76fac24c",
     "text": "Meaning, within the court of the tabernacle.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "tabernacle of the congregation before the"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.1.5",
   "range": "LEV.1.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1476b252",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.5#p1-f854bd09",
     "text": "A priest of the Levites.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "he shall kill the bullock before"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.5#p2-80d8b7d7",
     "text": "Of the burnt offering, Ex 27:1.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "altar that is by the door",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 27:1",
       "ref": "EXO.27.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.1.9",
   "range": "LEV.1.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3ef4b29a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.9#p1-3ef4b29a",
     "text": "Or a savour of rest, which pacifies the anger of the Lord.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "unto the LORD"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.1.11",
   "range": "LEV.1.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "57d88644",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.11#p1-adeed033",
     "text": "Read Le 1:5.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "And he shall kill it on",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Le 1:5",
       "ref": "LEV.1.5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.11#p2-7b591359",
     "text": "Before the altar of the Lord.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "before the LORD"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.1.15",
   "range": "LEV.1.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "eff31b56",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.15#p1-eff31b56",
     "text": "The Hebrew word signifies to pinch off with the nail.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "wring off his head"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.1.16",
   "range": "LEV.1.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "45a7036d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.1.16#p1-45a7036d",
     "text": "On the side of the court gate in the pans which stood with ashes; Ex 27:3.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "east part",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 27:3",
       "ref": "EXO.27.3"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
